{"ref":"BDB, גְּדוֹר","hw":"גְּדוֹר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדוֹר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֹר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr. (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">جِدَارٌ</span> <em>wall</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong> n.pr.loc.</strong> city of Judah <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:58\" href=\"/Joshua.15.58\">Jos 15:58</a>; also as n.pr.m., under fig. of genealogy <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֹר</span> son of Penuel <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.4\">1 Ch 4:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדוֹר</span> son of Yered <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.18\">1 Ch 4:18</a>; also <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגְּדוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.7\">1 Ch 12:7</a> v. d. H. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגְּדוּד</span> Baer, cf. his note.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> n.pr.loc.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.39\">1 Ch 4:39</a>, but read Gerar, according to 𝔊 Ew Hi Be al.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <strong> n.pr.m.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּדוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.31\">1 Ch 8:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.37\">9:37</a> a Benjamite, of Gibeon.","next":"BDB, גדשׁ","prev":"BDB, גְּדֵרִי"}